// Template. Copy to Secrets.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill in.
//
//     cp ios/Secrets.example.xcconfig ios/Secrets.xcconfig
//
// or let scripts/bootstrap_ios_secrets.sh do it, which is what CI runs (it
// takes the value from the ESRI_API_KEY env var / repo secret).
//
// ArcGIS Location Platform key for the Esri satellite basemap.
//
// This is NOT a secret. It is compiled into Info.plist and ships in the app
// bundle, so anyone can extract it. It's a quota and billing control. Keep
// pay-as-you-go switched OFF on the Esri account: then a leaked key can only
// burn the free 2M tiles/month, and the blast radius is "online basemap stops
// working", not a bill. Offline packs are unaffected either way.
//
// Leaving it empty is fine and supported. Online basemaps are opt-in, and with
// no key the Esri source is simply unavailable.
//
// Watch out: xcconfig treats // as a comment, even mid-value. If a key ever
// contains a double slash it has to be escaped. Esri keys are base64url
// (A-Z a-z 0-9 - _ .) so this shouldn't bite, but that's why it's written down.
ESRI_API_KEY =
